  "id": "policy.strict-disposition",
  "kind": "policy",
  "proposedId": "policy.strict-disposition",
  "text": "Strict disposition (a rule opts in via its own metadata.disposition: strict):\n- The enforcing checker (atdd-bun extension/gate/validator/runner) fails on every finding of the rule; findings are enforced, never advisory.\n- No advisory mode and no ratchet baseline: pre-existing violations in unchanged code are findings too, as are newly introduced ones.\n- Findings are not suppressible; any finding blocks/fails CI.",
